# Ruleset: Owned services
#
# Expects a proxy policy.
#
# The maintainer's own zones. Named so their exit is the profile's proxy policy instead of whatever the catch-all group is switched to. Must follow Process/ProxyCores.list, so a proxy core that fetches its configuration from one of these zones keeps the direct path when no proxy answers.

DOMAIN-SUFFIX,harisfox.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okis.dev
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okis.me
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okisdev.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,okisdev.workers.dev
